  "description": "Scaffold of the Plaid app emulator: it launches as --port=N, answers GET /admin/health with {\"status\":\"ok\"}, and serves the shared admin plane (reset, state, config, quirks). Sandbox public token creation, public token exchange (Item and access token creation), Item reads (item/get), account reads (accounts/get) and Link token creation and reads (link/token/create, link/token/get) are served. A new Item starts with three default accounts taken from the sample response in Plaid's public docs, a provisional fixture to be replaced once the Sandbox default set is captured; the remaining Plaid API routes arrive in later slices of build plan plaid-bp1.",
